    "summary": "Use it in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), as soon as an enemy unit selects an **ORKS** unit of yours that is not **TITANIC** as a target. That **ORKS** unit is the target.\n\nFor the rest of that phase, whenever 1 of its models is **destroyed**, if the unit has yet to be **selected to fight** in this phase, roll a D6 (adding 1 if the unit is **riled up**), and on a 4+:\n\n- leave that model on the battlefield for now\n- remove it after the unit has fought or when the phase ends, whichever is sooner",
